# Intentionally no rewrite rules.
#
# Clean URLs (/books, /about, ...) are served automatically by Cloudflare
# Pages from the matching *.html files, and Pages 308-canonicalizes /page.html
# to /page on its own. Adding "/page /page.html 200" rewrites here fought that
# canonicalization and produced an ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS loop
# (/page -> /page.html -> 308 /page -> ...), so those rules were removed.
#
# The "www -> root" redirect is a Cloudflare dashboard Redirect Rule, not a
# repo concern. Do not add a catch-all or asset rewrites here.
